Article 2 (Matters Subject to Consultation and Coordination) Matters subject to consultation and coordination by the Nakdong River Basin Management Committee (hereinafter referred to as the "Committee") pursuant to Article 37 (1) 6 of the Act on Water Management and Resident Support in the Nakdong River Basin (hereinafter referred to as the "Act") shall be as follows:
1. Matters concerning purchase of land, etc. under Article 8 of the Act;
2. Matters concerning plans for resident support projects under Article 23 of the Act;
3. Matters concerning support for water quality conservation or monitoring activities under Article 39 (1) of the Act.
